# Wrangler writes a local cache (Cloudflare account id + account name, which is an
# email address) into any directory it is run from. This project has nothing to do
# with Cloudflare, but a stray `npx wrangler ...` in this cwd would otherwise leave
# that cache untracked and one `git add -A` away from being published.
.wrangler/
